---
// The card — pit-board sample stack, PORT of the reference "sample bag" band.
// Clearly synthetic: every figure below is an illustrative composition of the
// planned workspace, labeled in-page; nothing here is a live run.
---

<section class="band" id="pb-card" aria-labelledby="pb-card-h">
	<div class="band-head">
		<div>
			<p class="lbl mono" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">the card</p>
			<h2 id="pb-card-h" class="h2">One card, the whole state of the build.</h2>
		</div>
		<p class="lede">
			Ordered by what needs you next — the clock first, then the verdict,
			then the work that is actually open.
		</p>
	</div>

	<p class="demo-banner">Illustrative preview — not a live run</p>

	<div class="stackgrid">
		<div class="frag span2">
			<p class="frag-k"><span style=`color: var(--pb-warn)`><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"></path></svg>clock · deadline</span><span class="pill" style=`background: var(--pb-tint-warn); color: var(--pb-warn)`>locked</span></p>
			<h4>Submit by Oct 26 · 5pm EDT — video is the artifact</h4>
			<div class="nested" style=`background: var(--pb-tint-warn); display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; align-items: center`>
				<p class="big" style=`font-size: 2rem; color: var(--pb-warn); margin: 0`>31<span style="font-size: 0.5em; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">d</span></p>
				<div>
					<p class="mrow"><span class="k">Your time</span><span class="ar" style=`color: var(--pb-warn)`>→</span><span class="v">Sun 26 Oct, 10:00</span></p>
					<p class="mrow"><span class="k">Review</span><span class="ar" style=`color: var(--pb-warn)`>→</span><span class="v">Oct 22</span></p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<p class="note"><span class="mk" style=`color: var(--pb-warn)`>▸</span>Judges will not run your code. Presentation is 25% of the score.</p>
			<p class="fresh">· updated 3h ago</p>
		</div>

		<div class="frag">
			<p class="frag-k"><span style=`color: var(--pb-danger)`><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 2 20h20z"></path><path d="M12 10v4M12 17.5v.5"></path></svg>fault · rules</span><span class="pill" style=`background: var(--pb-tint-danger); color: var(--pb-danger)`>blocked</span></p>
			<h4>No deadline parsed from the rules yet</h4>
			<p class="mrow" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;"><span class="k">Page</span><span class="ar" style=`color: var(--pb-danger)`>→</span><span class="v">the contest rules</span></p>
			<p class="mrow"><span class="k">Meaning</span><span class="ar" style=`color: var(--pb-danger)`>→</span><span class="v">unknown, not "no deadline"</span></p>
			<span class="cta-tag" style=`background: var(--pb-danger); color: var(--pb-on-key)`>Retry in chat</span>
		</div>

		<div class="frag">
			<p class="frag-k"><span style=`color: var(--pb-ok)`>verdict · fit</span><span class="pill" style=`background: var(--pb-tint-ok); color: var(--pb-ok)`>strong fit</span></p>
			<h4>Eligible, and it fits your week</h4>
			<p class="mrow" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;"><span class="k">Stack</span><span class="ar" style=`color: var(--pb-ok)`>→</span><span class="v">React + Hono</span></p>
			<p class="mrow"><span class="k">Payout</span><span class="ar" style=`color: var(--pb-ok)`>→</span><span class="v">wire to personal account</span></p>
			<p class="fresh">· updated 6h ago</p>
		</div>

		<div class="frag">
			<p class="frag-k"><span style=`color: var(--pb-ok)`>plan · docs</span><span class="pill" style=`background: var(--pb-tint-ok); color: var(--pb-ok)`>ready</span></p>
			<h4>Build brief is signed off</h4>
			<div class="chips"><span class="chip"><b>✓</b> scope.md</span><span class="chip"><b>✓</b> prd.md</span><span class="chip"><b>✓</b> spec.md</span></div>
			<span class="cta-tag" style=`background: var(--pb-ok); color: var(--pb-on-key)`>Read the plan</span>
		</div>

		<div class="frag">
			<p class="frag-k"><span>watch · rules</span><span class="pill">quiet</span></p>
			<h4>Nothing moved since yesterday</h4>
			<p class="mrow" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;"><span class="k">Last check</span><span class="ar">→</span><span class="v">18:40 · clean</span></p>
			<p class="fresh">· low stakes, deliberately muted</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<p class="bagnote">
		Illustrative composition of the planned workspace card — reconstructed from
		the fresh-build plan, not a live capture. Every state shown is one Caddie
		will render; no run produced this board.
	</p>
</section>
